@using System.Web.Mvc



<h6 class="am-submodule-title">Requisition workflow (school)</h6>

<div class="mb-3">

    <p class="mb-3">

        Configure procurement under <strong>Settings &rarr; Approval Matrix</strong> (process: <strong>Requisition</strong>).

        Stage 1 approver is typically <strong>Procurement Manager</strong>.

        Teachers do not log in; Facilities transcribes offline class needs into requisitions.

    </p>



    <ol class="small text-muted mb-3 ps-3">

        <li><strong>Facilities Manager</strong> submits a requisition for a leaf department (class or admin).</li>

        <li><strong>Procurement Manager</strong> approves, records a purchase order, and selects a supplier.</li>

        <li><strong>Procurement Manager</strong> receives goods and chooses placement: requisition department or company custody.</li>

        <li><strong>Facilities Manager</strong> is notified and completes physical handover to the class.</li>

    </ol>



    <div class="table-responsive">

        <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-0">

            <thead class="table-light">

                <tr>

                    <th>Role</th>

                    <th>Typical responsibility</th>

                    <th>Key permissions</th>

                </tr>

            </thead>

            <tbody>

                <tr>

                    <td class="fw-semibold">Facilities Manager</td>

                    <td>Submit requisitions for any class/admin department; assign or transfer assets after receipt</td>

                    <td class="small text-muted"><code>Purchases.Create</code>, <code>Purchases.CreateForAnyDepartment</code>, <code>Assets.Assign</code>, <code>Assets.Transfer</code></td>

                </tr>

                <tr>

                    <td class="fw-semibold">Procurement Manager</td>

                    <td>Approve requisitions, manage suppliers/catalog, record POs, receive goods</td>

                    <td class="small text-muted"><code>Purchases.Approve</code>, <code>Purchases.Edit</code>, <code>Suppliers.*</code>, <code>Assets.Receive</code></td>

                </tr>

                <tr>

                    <td class="fw-semibold">Company Admin</td>

                    <td>Configure departments, classes, users, and approval matrix</td>

                    <td class="small text-muted"><code>Settings.Manage</code>, <code>Departments.*</code>, <code>Users.*</code></td>

                </tr>

                <tr>

                    <td class="fw-semibold">Teachers / class staff</td>

                    <td>No login — optional custodian and “Order by” on requisitions only</td>

                    <td class="small text-muted">No login role</td>

                </tr>

            </tbody>

        </table>

    </div>

    <p class="text-muted small mt-3 mb-0">

        Requisitions require a leaf target department.

        Users cannot approve their own submitted requisitions.

        Opening-balance assets are imported separately via <strong>Import Assets</strong>.

    </p>

</div>

